<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>03 / 单题引擎</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>错题与题库：八维查找与学生复盘路径</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#E8A33D' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>部分实现</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 620, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={620} height={400} viewBox='0 0 620 400'><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='400' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='40' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><rect x='0' y='26' width='620' height='14' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='16' y='26' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>StudyAgent</text><rect x='18' y='58' width='584' height='26' rx='4' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='30' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>错题检索：步骤 · 错因 · 知识点 · 套路</text><rect x='18' y='92' width='584' height='28' rx='14' fill='#EAF3FD'/><text x='30' y='111' font-size='14' fill='#1E7BE0' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>题型 · 难度 · 来源 · 作答状态</text><rect x='18' y='128' width='584' height='52' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 4'/><text x='30' y='160' font-size='14' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>示例：查找“建系之后求法向量”出错的题目</text><rect x='18' y='188' width='584' height='52' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 4'/><text x='30' y='220' font-size='14' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>区分：题目含该步骤 / 学生在该步骤出过错</text><rect x='18' y='248' width='584' height='34' rx='17' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='310.0' y='271' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>加入题单 · 组卷 · 步骤专项练习</text><text x='608' y='390' font-size='12' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='end' font-weight='400'>示意占位 · S07 / S08 / S09</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>界面要点</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>八个查找维度：步骤、错因、知识点、套路、题型、难度、来源、作答状态，可组合并整理为个人题单。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>典型用法一：比较同一步骤每次错误的具体位置。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>典型用法二：区分偶发失误与多次出现的问题。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>典型用法三：查找“看过答案才完成、尚未独立复测”的题目。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>复盘路径：找到错题 → 查看错误步骤与原始作答 → 回放停顿及回改片段 → 确认或修正错因 → 查找同类步骤题目 → 整理题单或组卷 → 独立重做与新题复测 → 比较新旧步骤表现。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ marginTop: 6, padding: '9px 14px', background: '#F5F7FA', borderRadius: 6, alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>示意占位 S07 / S08 / S09 · 待替换为实际截图</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：单题功能设计思路.md §6</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 32 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>